{"title":"Frost Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Frost Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon?lv=61\">Lv 61</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>49</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon?lv=65\">Lv 65 <span>53</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>49</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>65</b></td><td>490</td><td>40.3</td><td>3,250</td><td class=\"muted\">1,470 · 56.4 · 9,750</td><td>53</td><t