thumb\" src=\"data/img/2688ac9988cad641486e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-arms\" title=\"Thorn Arms - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e0c6f0d49af674afeae9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-spear\" title=\"Titanium Spear - in 1 of 7 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/025903982d7f079cd8a5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Frostfang&#39;s Eyrie</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 102</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6504\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Frost Dra